@flexiarg cascades/declared-skeleton
@title Declared Skeleton
@sigils [🦴/骨]
@keywords cascade, declared, edge, upstream, witness, audit, sparse, skeleton, taxonomy, semilattice
@audience knowledge-base designers, agent-system builders
@tone design
@factor Discernment (paññā)
@provenance M-apm-demonstration W.67-W.70 (2026-08-17); Moran 1971 reading (futon5a); cascade-formation analysis (futon3c/docs/cascade-formation-patterns.md)

! conclusion:
  Declare, in the pattern files themselves, the sparse minority of pattern-to-pattern relations
  that are stable across contexts — plural, defeasible upstreams, each with its own because —
  and sync them to the store as typed edges. Declare only what you would defend in review.

  + context: A pattern store is growing by promotion, and downstream machinery (spectral
    measurement, reviewer navigation, reproducible retrieval) needs a definite graph, while
    most candidate relations are contextual and should NOT be frozen.

  + IF:
      A relation between two patterns holds in every context you can produce (a genuine
      specialization or enablement), and some consumer needs to rely on it repeatably.

  + HOWEVER:
      A single mandatory upstream re-imposes the tree Alexander rejected: patterns have multiple
      parents and the overlaps carry the intelligence. Declarations must be plural, optional,
      and revisable (see cascades/repointable-declarations) — never exactly-one, never frozen.

  + THEN:
      Author an upstreams field in the pattern file (the same place the because-clause lives),
      one line of justification per edge; let the ingest watcher create the store edges; keep
      the declared layer sparse enough that every edge survives adversarial review.

  + BECAUSE:
      Declaration is what makes an edge witnessable, versionable, and refusable — an undeclared
      cascade cannot be measured, reviewed, or diffed. The store's fragmentation (nine patterns,
      zero shared structure) was only VISIBLE because attachments were declared; structure that
      exists nowhere but in an agent's momentary judgment teaches the store nothing.

  + NEXT-STEPS:
    next[Identify the relations you would defend in review; leave the rest to derivation.]
    next[Author plural upstreams with one-line becauses in the pattern files.]
    next[Verify the watcher ingests them as typed edges; measure the skeleton, not the filigree.]
